### Transfer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "85a013b8-cd1a-414b-b553-cea3f724a506",
  "targetAccountId": "6fa056c1-8844-4a13-b2f8-21bd3ea39739",
  "amount": 5.00,
  "description": "Transfer to savings"
}
### Get source account
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/85a013b8-cd1a-414b-b553-cea3f724a506

### Get target account
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/6fa056c1-8844-4a13-b2f8-21bd3ea39739